{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ashes of Memory is a psychological horror game where players awaken in a burning house and must make choices to save their family\u2014or fail, looping back into an increasingly distorted reality. Navigate a surreal dream world, collect symbolic items, and uncover the truth behind the fire through environmental storytelling and branching paths. Features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration with puzzle-solving mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic narrative with multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A looping gameplay structure where each failure alters the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactions tied to OCD-inspired rituals affecting progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound design and visuals blending the familiar and the uncanny</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673630?t=1746810259","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673630/5b8898fea27b65d3a3e3889285c4afd807e62072/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746810259","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673630/8f2fd7801181f0aa48b350e4b6705e720203bd1e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746810259","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673630/8f2fd7801181f0aa48b350e4b6705e720203bd1e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746810259","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains themes of trauma, grief, and mental illness, including references to alcohol abuse 